# Kimss Python quickstart — AI assistants

Follow [AI_INTEGRATION.md](AI_INTEGRATION.md).

Prefer `example_02_openai_override.py`: OpenAI client, `base_url=https://api.kimss.ai/v1`, `extra_headers` with `X-Kimss-Agent-Id`. Never generate `KimssClient` chat/completions. Keys are `kimss_...`. Kill switch: `agent_disabled`.
